    "description": "Tobacco Pipe Lot - 8 Pieces\nPeterson's and Mixed Brands, Briar Wood\nVintage Era\nThis collection features eight vintage estate tobacco pipes, including a notable Peterson's pipe and a commemorative 1993 Christmas pipe. The lot showcases a diverse array of traditional pipe shapes, finishes, and stem materials, representing classic mid-to-late 20th-century smoking accessories. These pieces are ideal for restoration enthusiasts or as additions to a historical smoking memorabilia collection.\nPeterson's K&P estate pipe featuring a silver-tone metal band\nRed-finished briar pipe marked \"Christmas 1993\" on the shank\nUnique clear acrylic stem pipe with a blue and black swirled bowl\nVarious briar wood pipes including straight and bent billiard shapes\nOne detached vintage dark wood pipe bowl\nCondition:\nStains are present throughout the lot. The bowls show significant charring and carbon buildup consistent with regular use. Plastic and vulcanite stems exhibit varying degrees of oxidation, surface scratches, and light teeth chatter. Finish wear, small nicks, and surface staining are visible on the wood surfaces. All items are sold as-is for restoration or display.",
